# Digital vs. Analog Video on Microcomputers: Implications for Information Management.

**Authors:** Chen, Ching-chih

## Abstract
Describes microcomputer-based digital video technology and compares it to analog video. Topics discussed include converting analog video to digital data; digital image compression technology; digital compression and digital video on Macintosh computers; and potential library and information-related applications, including electronic publishing and communications media. (four references) (LRW)

